// StimLab Windows resources.
//
// The application icon. As the lowest-id icon resource it becomes the exe's icon in
// Explorer / the taskbar, and WinMain loads it (id 101) for the window class so the
// title bar + taskbar show the brand mark. Regenerate StimLab.ico via
// scripts/make-icon.ps1.
101 ICON "StimLab.ico"
